    "detailed_description": "All the features added to this game are suggestions and comments made in the comment section of Flizz's YouTube channel, in this game, you play as Bob, each run you get to choose a class for Bob, and based on that you can unlock Common and Unique Subclasses that give Bob unique abilities to help him beat all his enemies! Be ready for a bunch of enemies and broken (But hopefully fun) Mechanics!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159050/extras/7bb9cd43fafa9a8ce18846d75266cff8.poster.avif?t=1725637728\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159050/extras/7bb9cd43fafa9a8ce18846d75266cff8.webm?t=1725637728\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159050/extras/7bb9cd43fafa9a8ce18846d75266cff8.mp4?t=1725637728\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "All the features added to this game are suggestions and comments made in the comment section of Flizz's YouTube channel, in this game, you play as Bob, each run you get to choose a class for Bob, and based on that you can unlock Common and Unique Subclasses that give Bob unique abilities to help him beat all his enemies! Be ready for a bunch of enemies and broken (But hopefully fun) Mechanics!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159050/extras/7bb9cd43fafa9a8ce18846d75266cff8.poster.avif?t=1725637728\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159050/extras/7bb9cd43fafa9a8ce18846d75266cff8.webm?t=1725637728\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159050/extras/7bb9cd43fafa9a8ce18846d75266cff8.mp4?t=1725637728\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
